runner_scan_inline.zig replaces runner_scan_mod.zig; its φ rule (a parenthesis glued to a non-ASCII letter) replaces c061290ef's, and the φ/λ test cases stay. The inline gcd step moves into Routed.graphFirst.

Squashed merge of 1 commits:
- runner: inline arithmetic with thousands commas, brackets and a whole gcd(a, b) (Jay Leaton)
